Package: vmodv-native
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: VmodV <vmodv@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fayaaz/modV
Depends: libc6, libasound2, libpipewire-0.3-0, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, libvulkan1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-pipewire
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: Native Rust audio visualiser from the VmodV project
 VmodV Native is the single-process Rust/egui build of modV, a modular audio
 visualiser with WebGPU and ISF scenes, performance mode and live audio
 analysis.
 .
 It ships the ISF corpus and Point10 textures. GStreamer, PipeWire, Vulkan and
 the X11/Wayland libraries are provided by the host distribution.
